out god "\n\rThe septon's beating decimates Rambler!\n\rThe septon's beating mauls Pickpocket.\n\rPickpocket's slash misses the septon.\n\rRambler's slash misses the septon.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe septon's beating mauls Rambler.\n\rRambler is DEAD!!\n\rRambler got toasted by the septon at The Temple Of Mota [room 3001]\n\rRambler's leg is sliced from his dead body.\n\rPickpocket's slash misses the septon.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
